{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Abolish NHS workers car parking charges",
        "additional_details": "Onsite parking for NHS Staff ranges from region to region in England (in excess of \u00a325.00 per month), it\u2019s free in Scotland and Wales and has been since 2008, it is about time NHS staff in England also benefited from free parking. Also most of the time there isn\u2019t enough parking spaces onsite, therefore the staff don\u2019t park to the rules and receive hefty fine\u2019s. Private parking firms are making Millions out of the hard working staff, let\u2019s get this abolished and made illegal, let\u2019s help our NHS.",
        "background": "This petition is for the NHS Staff in England who have to pay for onsite parking to go to work. I would like to have this abolished and made illegal to charge NHS Staff for onsite parking.",
